[{"id": "74f7ac0", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-tpl ww-tpl-header", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "cea8063", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "template", "settings": {"template_id": "480"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "78c35b1", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark ww-phero ww-cityhero", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "uvod"}, "elements": [{"id": "dda12ac", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-hero-grid", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "daddf3b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-hero-copy", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "55ddb1f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><a href=\"/\">wwwwww.cz</a> / tvorba webových stránek</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-crumbs"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3e4fb19", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Hlavní služba", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow ww-rv"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3698f55", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Tvorba webových stránek<span class=\"ww-red\">.</span>", "header_size": "h1", "_css_classes": "ww-h1 ww-rv"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d9ce2ce", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek, které nejsou jen vizitkou, ale přivádějí poptávky. Navrhneme, napíšeme a spustíme web pro vaši firmu – osobně, srozumitelně a za férovou cenu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-lead ww-mw ww-rv"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2ed8eb1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "66380e8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci nezávaznou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c3d8b6b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Zavolat 731 842 606", "link": {"url": "tel:+420731842606", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--ghost ww-btn--plain"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "5234884", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>✓ Weby od 9 900 Kč</span><span>✓ Nabídka zdarma</span><span>✓ Koncept agentury Yesmark</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-trust ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c1fffbf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<figure class=\"v-hv\"><img src=\"https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg\" alt=\"Tvorba webových stránek – ukázka webu KONRADT\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Reference · KONRADT</figcaption></figure>", "_css_classes": "ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "044f00d", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white ww-tocsec", "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "c48585b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "89286d9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><b>Na této stránce:</b><a href=\"#o-sluzbe\">Tvorba webu, která začíná u vašeho byznysu</a><a href=\"#prehled\">Postup</a><a href=\"#detail\">Podrobnosti</a><a href=\"#reference\">Reference</a><a href=\"#cenik\">Cena a FAQ</a><a href=\"#poptavka\">Poptávka</a></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-toc"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "c0c8434", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "o-sluzbe"}, "elements": [{"id": "f87a563", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-local", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a5aad4a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-local-copy ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3eb339e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Hlavní služba", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4bba64c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Tvorba webu, která začíná u vašeho byznysu", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ce981d0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dobrý web nezačíná výběrem barev, ale otázkou: co má návštěvník udělat? Zavolat, poslat poptávku, rezervovat termín, nebo nakoupit? Tvorba webových stránek u nás proto začíná krátkým rozhovorem o vašich zákaznících, službách a konkurenci. Teprve potom navrhujeme strukturu, texty a design.</p><p>Za wwwwww.cz stojí webové studio z Jeseníku a tým marketingové agentury Yesmark. Weby tvoříme pro řemeslníky, služby, ubytování, výrobní firmy i obce a spolky z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží osobně nebo online – jak vám to vyhovuje.</p><p>Profesionální tvorba webových stránek pro nás znamená kompletní servis: návrh, texty, fotky, technické nastavení, základní SEO, napojení na Google Analytics a předání webu tak, abyste si ho uměli sami upravovat.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b789ed4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-citycard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2706489", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Co dostanete", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "66c6075", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul class=\"ww-checklist\"><li>Návrh struktury a designu na míru</li><li>Web pro mobil, tablet i počítač</li><li>Pomoc s texty a fotkami</li><li>Základní SEO a Google Firemní profil</li><li>Formuláře, mapy a napojení na e-mail</li><li>Cookies lištu a GDPR</li><li>Zaškolení do administrace</li><li>Podporu i po spuštění</li></ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4167519", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Probrat můj web", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "48709f8", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "prehled"}, "elements": [{"id": "ac22dad", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9f61b28", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "991e45d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ac15094", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Postup", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0a46348", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Jak probíhá tvorba webových stránek", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "edc8802", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Osm kroků od prvního hovoru po web, který pracuje za vás. Vždy víte, v jaké fázi projekt je.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "ad35e4c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-grid4", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "dd38724", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6914531", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "01", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7d985cc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Úvodní hovor", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f4d6761", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Probereme cíle, zákazníky a rozpočet – telefonicky, online, nebo u kávy v Jeseníku.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d103aae", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7a4f60a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "02", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "392d1ee", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nabídka zdarma", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8ccc7af", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dostanete jasnou cenu, rozsah a termín. Bez skrytých položek.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0c033d8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "08b4ff1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "03", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b77aa01", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Struktura webu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "030d3af", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Navrhneme, jaké stránky web potřebuje a jak po nich návštěvník dojde k poptávce.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "a31c893", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "93bf0b9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "04", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f62313d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Obsah", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "12eaaa9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pomůžeme s texty, které prodávají a zároveň dobře fungují ve vyhledávačích.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d5670e7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8cd42b1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e6fea1c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Design", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "525728c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Grafický návrh v duchu vaší značky. Připomínkujete, dokud nejste spokojení.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "64bd418", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ab2e9af", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5cd8fb7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Realizace", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0e6526e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web postavíme na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "40fd32f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3054b9b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a29a8fd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a7b3530", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Doména, hosting, SSL, Analytics, Search Console a kontrola všech formulářů.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "038ac10", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "277e11c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f50347b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Péče po spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fddcc52", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Aktualizace, zálohy, úpravy a další rozvoj webu podle výsledků.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "912cd27", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "00a377e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0668ff7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proč tvorba webu na míru místo šablony", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f7146de", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web z online stavebnice vypadá podobně jako tisíce dalších a často naráží na limity – v SEO, ve vlastnictví dat i v možnostech dalšího rozvoje. Tvorba webu na míru znamená, že strukturu, texty i design přizpůsobíme vašemu oboru a zákazníkům.</p><h3>Web, který si upravíte sami</h3><p>Stavíme převážně na WordPressu a Elementoru. Texty, fotky, ceník nebo novou stránku změníte sami bez programátora. Ukážeme vám, jak na to, a když budete chtít, úpravy převezmeme.</p><h3>SEO od prvního dne</h3><p>Každá stránka má promyšlené nadpisy, popisky, interní odkazy a strukturovaná data. Web tak má od začátku šanci ukázat se lidem, kteří hledají vaše služby na Googlu.</p><h3>Pro klienty z celé České republiky</h3><p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale tvorba webových stránek u nás není vázaná na region. Pracujeme pro klienty z Olomouckého, Moravskoslezského i Pardubického kraje a z celého Česka.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "dc25141", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "e086c73", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "94fa479", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "32feda5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1873411", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c871461", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9b6cf57", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "4d38dee", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "892f9f5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6167a4e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4478136", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e718d32", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "1a93151", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2931229", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e4ab856", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "578bdfc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "78eecd7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "08bc43c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true,